g heads.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zaUUew3sOGY5dmiDpCYADhqGhzL.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-10-28\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"It's My Party and I'll Spend if I Want To\",\"overview\":\"Taylor Armstrong and Kyle Richards throw typical Beverly Hills birthday parties for their daughters.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8c48q9LzSBUdyaIld0sKLzOP2bm.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-04\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"I Would Never Say That\",\"overview\":\"Tension mounts as Camille Grammer confronts Kyle Richards in New York!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6ewCGFR0wNDkjKY2Wv49rAU7Mo2.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-11\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Art of War\",\"overview\":\"Still in New York, the women are all reeling over the past evening's meltdown and Kim continues to add fuel to the fire. It's the day of Kelsey's premiere and everyone’s nerves are fraught.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3P5VSOABqT1DahAGC4aCQewMgKd.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-11-18\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"My Mansion Is Bigger Than Your Mansion\",\"overview\":\"Lisa VanderPump plays matchmaker and Taylor Armstrong questions her marriage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6n39dzo1IQWDuclLzbpgWrh0aMu.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-02\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Charity Cases\",\"overview\":\"Kyle Richards is in Napa, Kim Richards invites her date to her house, Lisa VanderPump gets hit on at the DMV, and Taylor Armstrong prepares for her charity event.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1wuvQtq4OqdHZEiP5Z8ttVNMfOw.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-09\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"The Dinner Party from Hell\",\"overview\":\"Camille throws a glamorous dinner party at her Malibu home and, in addition to the housewives, she invites a few special guests. The guests, however, bring up a sore subject and sparks fly between all the women in an explosive showdown.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jS8ocDmpIIVIymtHLlo5iGiYiT.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-16\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Payback's a Bitch... Just Ask Your Husband\",\"overview\":\"Lisa holds a charity event at her restaurant and the ladies attend to show their support. Camille, however, is still dealing with the fallout. Taylor also holds a big event and it's the first time Camille and Kyle are face to face since the last blow-up.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/l74u24JTeKSOXezqoOaD189SmgW.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2010-12-23\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"How to Behave\",\"overview\":\"Lisa VanderPump and her husband Ken are at odds with Cedric and Camille Grammer invites the ladies over for a fun tennis tournament. Taylor Armstrong and her husband Russell don't seem happy at Kyle Richards' party for Mauricio.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8yziwsR3Yld2wFmb7jamyKc7nZo.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-06\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Turn, Turn, Turn\",\"overview\":\"Lisa VanderPump comforts Cedric about moving out, Kyle Richards prepares for her daughter's college graduation, and Camille Grammer's marriage falls apart.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e1LHQ19xpytZCPCUlvpdp3Jv3CI.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-13\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"Unforgivable\",\"overview\":\"Taylor's birthday is coming up and everyone is excited. Kim and Kyle finally go to blows after years of pent up family frustration. Meanwhile, another bond is breaking as Camille gets word from her husband that he wants to end their marriage.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kjxAU3D0SJwqIdxxyvvsAk40FqH.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-20\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"Reunion (1)\",\"overview\":\"The Beverly Hills ladies join Andy Cohen and answer some of America's most burning questions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cnzLYAOI4OEwGXeW2XqkoUSaHXH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-01-27\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"Reunion (2)\",\"overview\":\"The season reunion picks up where it left off as the women confront each other and confront the viewers as they must answer tough questions.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rzUJfaR8oDNxsNpOSukNJoctDUw.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-01\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":16,\"name\":\"The Lost Footage\",\"overview\":\"Catch never-before-seen footage of the most talked about Housewives in 90210.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e7s4LJsgFfV1CqWqCNgXdNTomIy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-08\",\"runtime\":43},{\"number\":17,\"name\":\"The Dinner Party from Hell - Producers Cut\",\"overview\":\"Camille throws a glamorous dinner party at her Malibu home and, in addition to the housewives, she invites a few special guests. The guests, however, bring up a sore subject and sparks fly between all the women in an explosive showdown.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dFxCPgtt6jnq5kYT5CI7SlD65LS.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"voteCount\":2,\"airDate\":\"2011-02-15\",\"runtime\":43}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2010-10-14\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}